    "updated_at": "2025-08-26T03:02:10Z",
    "body": "For the record, [path components](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-input-file-path) are currently defined as shown here:\n\n> **Path components**, for the purposes of the [File Upload](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#file-upload-state-(type=file)) state, are those parts of filenames that are separated by U+005C REVERSE SOLIDUS character (\\\\) characters.",
