    "updated_at": "2025-08-26T03:17:52Z",
    "body": "It seems like this mess can be traced back to 2ac7318741183644c5c96f9f821044719b5d87d3, which in turn follows from 27c2bd0c52dedbae1f1eec572993a7767f120b3e. It seems like the definition of &#8216;path components&#8217; has subtly changed over time, from actual path components to abstract parts of strings.",
