    "updated_at": "2025-09-11T10:52:28Z",
    "body": "I don't think OP is accurate in stating that the full path would be available to the server. If that's the case in any browser it'd be a security issue.\n\nThere are probably some subtleties around unusual file names and how those map to multipart/form-data (see also #6424) still to be sorted, but that's very much a separate issue from clarifying why the path is hidden, which this issue is about.",
